WEBVTT

01:25.539 --> 01:29.900
[Coroner's Diary]

01:30.630 --> 01:33.910
[Episode 21]

01:36.350 --> 01:36.870
Master,

01:37.479 --> 01:39.550
Prince Cheng's men are
still outside.

01:39.550 --> 01:40.229
Prince Cheng

01:40.229 --> 01:41.950
apparently came here for Mr. Qin.

01:41.950 --> 01:43.509
Now, the victims' clothes are
mysteriously missing.

01:43.509 --> 01:44.229
I'm worried that...

01:44.229 --> 01:45.200
Capital Prefect,

01:45.200 --> 01:46.759
Young Master Qin is an strategist of mine.

01:46.759 --> 01:48.560
Please address her
as Master Wan from now on.

01:48.560 --> 01:49.320
Yes, I got it.

01:49.340 --> 01:50.670
-But now…
-Don’t worry.

01:51.200 --> 01:53.009
I only need four hours as I said.

01:53.630 --> 01:54.289
To proceed,

01:54.660 --> 01:57.100
I'll have to trouble Constable Zhan
for one thing.

01:57.100 --> 01:58.900
I'm at Your Highness's service.

01:59.020 --> 02:00.710
Please go to the East Water Gate

02:00.710 --> 02:02.630
and identify the fish vendors
who deliver fish to the restaurants

02:02.630 --> 02:03.590
in the West Market.

02:03.590 --> 02:04.060
Got it.

02:04.870 --> 02:05.740
Didn't Master Wan say

02:05.740 --> 02:07.710
the victim must've eaten in a small diner?

02:07.710 --> 02:10.889
Why would fish vendors
bother to make deliveries to small diners?

02:10.889 --> 02:12.110
Fish are fragile goods.

02:12.110 --> 02:14.470
Some are inevitably damaged
during transport.

02:14.470 --> 02:15.380
Fish vendors

02:15.380 --> 02:17.579
usually keep the dead and injured fish
for themselves,

02:17.579 --> 02:19.240
or sell them cheaply to small diners.

02:19.240 --> 02:20.300
Finding the right fish vendor

02:20.300 --> 02:22.350
will lead us to the diner
that purchased the fish.

02:22.350 --> 02:23.350
I understand now.

02:23.510 --> 02:24.640
But Prince Cheng...

02:25.790 --> 02:27.340
Master Wan is new to the city.

02:27.340 --> 02:28.700
I'll show her around first.

02:28.700 --> 02:30.160
It'll only take two hours.

02:30.230 --> 02:30.770
Bai Feng,

02:31.030 --> 02:31.700
be our coachman.

02:31.700 --> 02:32.190
Yes.

02:32.730 --> 02:33.640
Two hours...

02:40.910 --> 02:42.310
The Marquis of Zhongyong is
sparing no effort

02:42.310 --> 02:43.840
to assist the Crown Prince.

02:44.350 --> 02:46.260
I can't believe he'd drag you into this.

02:46.260 --> 02:48.860
I was looking for a chance
to enter the criminal justice system.

02:48.860 --> 02:50.579
What they've done suits me perfectly,

02:50.579 --> 02:52.130
and has saved you much trouble.

02:52.130 --> 02:53.329
I don't mind trouble.

02:54.350 --> 02:56.510
It's just that there's a tangled net of
power players behind this matter.

02:56.510 --> 02:58.790
I'm afraid the attention you get
will endanger you.

02:58.790 --> 03:00.880
Today, you've seen
the way Prince Cheng acts.

03:00.880 --> 03:01.710
You should be aware of

03:01.710 --> 03:03.860
the uncontainable hostility
between him and the Crown Prince

03:03.860 --> 03:04.660
You might be

03:04.660 --> 03:05.630
caught in their political struggles

03:05.630 --> 03:07.030
and reduced to a pawn of others'.

03:07.030 --> 03:07.890
I'm not afraid.

03:08.230 --> 03:09.140
Don't worry.

03:09.140 --> 03:10.310
I'll be cautious.

03:11.120 --> 03:13.190
To seek justice for the murdered women

03:13.190 --> 03:15.850
and to clear
Prince Jin's and my father's names,

03:16.100 --> 03:16.910
I must pursue

03:16.910 --> 03:18.100
this case to the end.

03:20.700 --> 03:21.420
Okay.

03:22.310 --> 03:23.960
Go ahead and act as you see fit.

03:23.960 --> 03:25.990
Just don't forget to keep your guard up.

03:25.990 --> 03:28.390
The Emperor has granted me
approval today.

03:28.660 --> 03:30.510
From now on, you can work on any cases

03:30.510 --> 03:32.710
undertaken by the Ministry of Justice.

03:33.650 --> 03:34.329
Thank you.

03:45.730 --> 03:47.370
[Prince Yi’s Mansion]

03:49.700 --> 03:52.230
Why did you bring me
to Prince Yi's residence?

03:52.510 --> 03:53.910
I want you to meet someone.

03:53.910 --> 03:55.840
It's also a way to lose those tails.

03:56.260 --> 03:57.860
It seems desolate. How come?

04:00.620 --> 04:02.850
It's a prince's mansion without a prince.

04:02.850 --> 04:04.580
How can it not appear desolate?

04:10.950 --> 04:11.750
Chi.

04:12.860 --> 04:14.290
Why are you here so early?

04:14.380 --> 04:15.620
Fix your clothes.

04:16.800 --> 04:18.660
Where did you hang out last night?

04:22.750 --> 04:23.970
Little Wan'er?

04:25.780 --> 04:28.310
Chi, why didn't you tell me
she was coming too?

04:28.310 --> 04:30.630
She might be charmed by my pretty looks.

04:30.900 --> 04:32.260
You can't blame me if that happens.

04:32.260 --> 04:34.580
Your Highness is worrying about nothing.

04:34.580 --> 04:36.930
You're dressed like a man
shortly after your return to the capital.

04:36.930 --> 04:38.400
Is it because you find
men's apparel classy,

04:38.400 --> 04:41.000
or because you're
investigating a case again?

04:41.810 --> 04:43.220
There's a spy for Yan Qi at the gate.

04:43.220 --> 04:44.380
Go chase him away.

04:45.310 --> 04:47.190
Why are Prince Cheng's people after you?

04:47.190 --> 04:49.330
You're not working on that tricky case
for the Crown Prince, are you?

04:49.330 --> 04:51.380
Cut the crap. Go get rid of that spy now.

04:51.380 --> 04:53.580
I'll wait till you come back
to visit Madam.

04:53.580 --> 04:54.840
You go visit her alone.

04:55.020 --> 04:57.020
She'd rather read scriptures than see me.

04:57.020 --> 04:59.080
She'd only make an exception for you.

04:59.170 --> 05:00.140
I'll go deal with

05:00.170 --> 05:01.170
that hateful spy.

05:02.780 --> 05:03.580
Your clothes!

05:12.110 --> 05:13.750
I've brought a friend to meet Madam.

05:13.750 --> 05:14.950
Is she available now?

05:15.340 --> 05:16.980
Madam is copying scriptures.

05:16.980 --> 05:18.180
Please wait a moment.

05:23.460 --> 05:25.750
Why do you all refer to
Yan Li's mother as "Madam"

05:25.750 --> 05:27.080
instead of "Princess"?

05:27.560 --> 05:28.690
I'll tell you later.

05:29.060 --> 05:30.320
Just call her "Madam."

05:41.530 --> 05:44.450
[Princess Yi]

05:49.280 --> 05:50.340
Greetings, Madam.

05:52.530 --> 05:54.240
I haven't seen you for over a year.

05:54.240 --> 05:57.100
Now, you're looking
more and more like your father.

05:59.700 --> 06:00.670
Who is this?

06:01.140 --> 06:03.190
She's Qin Wan,
the ninth child of the Qin family.

06:03.190 --> 06:04.520
Her father is Qin Liang.

06:05.990 --> 06:07.320
Nice to meet you, Madam.

06:08.060 --> 06:09.350
I didn't know about your visit,

06:09.350 --> 06:11.010
so I didn't prepare any gifts.

06:11.070 --> 06:12.460
I came here without notice.

06:12.460 --> 06:13.990
Apologies for my rudeness.

06:21.900 --> 06:23.300
This is not much of a gift,

06:23.550 --> 06:25.010
but I'd like you to have it.

06:25.630 --> 06:26.630
I can't accept it.

06:27.110 --> 06:27.870
Chi

06:28.110 --> 06:30.550
has finally brought a lady to meet me.

06:30.570 --> 06:31.840
I'm very delighted.

06:32.550 --> 06:33.409
Please take it.

06:34.070 --> 06:36.400
Maybe it'll remind you of me
in the future.

06:41.620 --> 06:42.620
Thank you, Madam.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.900
During our stay in the capital,

06:44.900 --> 06:46.380
we'll pay regular visits to you.

06:46.380 --> 06:47.140
No need.

06:47.780 --> 06:49.310
Just look after Li for me.

06:50.630 --> 06:51.310
Chi,

06:52.110 --> 06:53.070
if possible,

06:54.080 --> 06:55.550
leave the capital soon.

07:14.250 --> 07:15.400
I guess this hairpin

07:15.430 --> 07:18.160
symbolizes the love
between Madam and Prince Yi.

07:18.310 --> 07:19.700
Why did she give it to me,

07:19.990 --> 07:21.350
instead of saving it for Yan Li?

07:21.350 --> 07:22.280
Do you know about

07:22.810 --> 07:25.190
the rebellion staged by Fu Chengye
20 years ago,

07:25.190 --> 07:27.100
the then
Sichuan pacification commissioner?

07:27.100 --> 07:29.270
The Fu family were all executed
for that reason.

07:29.270 --> 07:31.400
Madam is Fu Chengye's younger sister.

07:32.340 --> 07:33.260
Then Prince Yi...

07:33.260 --> 07:34.140
Prince Yi

07:34.750 --> 07:36.080
reported to Fu Chengye.

07:36.180 --> 07:37.950
He was the inspector-general of Gongzhou,

07:37.950 --> 07:38.750
named Yan Han.

07:46.870 --> 07:49.220
Prince Yi was a farmer's son
who later enlisted with military forces.

07:49.220 --> 07:50.480
Given his brilliant track records,

07:50.480 --> 07:51.680
Fu Chengye valued him

07:52.650 --> 07:54.650
and married his own daughter to him.

07:57.850 --> 07:59.620
[Tier-one loyal warrior]

08:07.020 --> 08:09.270
[Fu Residence]

09:07.800 --> 09:10.390
When Prince Yi discovered
Fu Chengye's intent to start a coup,

09:10.390 --> 09:12.580
Madam was already pregnant with Yan Li.

09:12.580 --> 09:15.220
So, while pretending to escort Madam
to her hometown before labor,

09:15.220 --> 09:17.750
he was secretly rushing to the capital
to deliver the message.

09:17.750 --> 09:18.820
Later, he was informed

09:18.820 --> 09:20.950
that the Imperial Guards
led by the Crown Prince

09:20.950 --> 09:23.010
had been ambushed at the Storm Ridge.

10:08.360 --> 10:09.580
That was the current Emperor's first time

10:09.580 --> 10:11.710
to command a troop as the Crown Prince.

10:11.970 --> 10:13.080
By the time he realized it was a trap,

10:13.080 --> 10:15.420
he had been surrounded
by arrows dipped in tung oil.

10:15.420 --> 10:17.470
Prince Yi hurried to the Storm Ridge
overnight

10:17.470 --> 10:20.190
and single-handedly rescued
the Emperor from raging flames.

10:20.190 --> 10:20.990
Regrettably,

10:21.850 --> 10:23.450
the reinforcements arrived

10:23.940 --> 10:25.850
only to find Prince Yi had been burned
beyond recognition.

10:25.850 --> 10:28.220
Yet until his dying breath,
he had been guarding in front of

10:28.220 --> 10:29.950
the severely injured Emperor.

10:30.890 --> 10:32.970
The Emperor was deeply moved
by Yan Han's loyalty.

10:32.970 --> 10:35.100
After ascending the throne,
His Majesty overruled all objections

10:35.100 --> 10:36.500
and honored Yan as "Prince Yi"

10:36.500 --> 10:38.100
in memory of his allegiance.

10:38.310 --> 10:40.090
The Emperor also took Yan Li in
as his godson

10:40.090 --> 10:41.280
and bestowed upon him
the imperial surname,

10:41.280 --> 10:41.870
"Yan."

10:42.540 --> 10:44.740
So, Yan Li is just
an honorary heir of a prince.

10:44.740 --> 10:45.980
None of the capital's bigwigs

10:45.980 --> 10:48.580
truly consider him
as part of the royal family.

10:48.820 --> 10:50.880
Why wasn't Madam granted
the title of princess?

10:50.880 --> 10:53.010
Mrs. Yan meant to join Yan Han in death,

10:53.030 --> 10:54.310
but she couldn't bear the thought of

10:54.310 --> 10:55.700
Yan Li becoming parentless at a young age.

10:55.700 --> 10:56.670
After declining rewards and honors,

10:56.670 --> 10:58.030
she started living in seclusion.

10:58.030 --> 10:59.390
Fortunately, Grandmother

10:59.390 --> 11:01.580
treats Yan Li like her own grandson.

11:02.030 --> 11:03.550
As long as Grandmother lives,

11:03.550 --> 11:06.750
nobody in the palace
would dare to openly disrespect him.

11:09.130 --> 11:10.520
A lifelong commitment...

11:10.520 --> 11:11.720
Madam and Prince Yi

11:11.860 --> 11:13.660
really loved each other dearly.

11:17.950 --> 11:19.580
I suppose this wooden hairpin contains

11:19.580 --> 11:21.030
Madam's wish for us to be

11:21.450 --> 11:22.850
a loving couple forever.

11:28.290 --> 11:30.020
But if misfortunes befall you,

11:30.550 --> 11:32.490
I'll definitely not join you in death.

11:32.490 --> 11:34.400
I'll search every corner on earth

11:34.420 --> 11:35.720
to hunt down

11:35.800 --> 11:36.920
those who harmed you.

11:36.920 --> 11:38.680
Your words...

11:40.460 --> 11:41.920
have really put my mind...

11:43.310 --> 11:44.100
at ease.

11:44.640 --> 11:45.890
You can rest assured.

11:46.130 --> 11:47.280
Even if you die,

11:47.310 --> 11:48.770
I'll carry on with my life.

11:49.450 --> 11:50.180
I'm assured.

11:50.980 --> 11:52.380
You can rest assured too.

11:52.470 --> 11:54.330
By no means I'll die before you do.

12:13.000 --> 12:13.600
Master!

12:14.750 --> 12:20.480
[Capital Prefecture]

12:15.100 --> 12:15.910
I misled

12:15.930 --> 12:18.700
those spies
to the Maquis of Zhongyong's mansion.

12:18.700 --> 12:19.450
Have the Dove Unit

12:19.450 --> 12:20.740
take them for a tour around the capital,

12:20.740 --> 12:22.010
so they can't get in our way.

12:22.010 --> 12:22.570
Got it.

12:22.710 --> 12:23.500
Your Highness,

12:23.500 --> 12:24.190
Master Wan,

12:24.500 --> 12:25.700
I have a small finding now.

12:25.700 --> 12:27.710
The capital prefect has been waiting.

12:27.710 --> 12:29.840
Please lead the way, Constable Zhang.

12:37.910 --> 12:39.460
No intimate contact here.

12:39.800 --> 12:42.130
I won't share a carriage with you anymore.

12:42.460 --> 12:43.460
Not here?

12:43.970 --> 12:45.610
Then anywhere else is fine?

12:53.090 --> 12:54.290
Thank you for coming.

12:54.340 --> 12:55.430
I was just wondering

12:55.430 --> 12:57.670
where the perpetrator captured
these three victims,

12:57.670 --> 12:58.980
since there is zero connection
among these girls,

12:58.980 --> 13:00.880
and their workplaces are far from

13:01.730 --> 13:03.500
where their bodies were dumped.

13:03.500 --> 13:04.980
No need to rush, Capital Prefect.

13:04.980 --> 13:06.270
Constable Zhan, can you

13:06.270 --> 13:07.530
get us some red strings,

13:07.530 --> 13:08.090
red pens

13:08.290 --> 13:09.340
and pins?

13:09.890 --> 13:10.610
Sure.

13:12.220 --> 13:14.420
What does Your Highness need those for?

13:16.500 --> 13:18.620
The murderer hasn't left a trail.

13:19.120 --> 13:20.520
It means this person acts

13:20.620 --> 13:22.620
with extreme caution and prudence.

13:22.740 --> 13:23.700
People of this kind

13:23.700 --> 13:26.030
usually commit crimes in familiar places

13:26.030 --> 13:27.820
and premeditate the timing

13:27.820 --> 13:28.670
and routes.

13:29.050 --> 13:31.100
This perpetrator kills every half a month.

13:31.100 --> 13:32.860
If he ran a tailor shop independently,

13:32.860 --> 13:33.980
he wouldn't have the time

13:33.980 --> 13:35.820
to look around for preys in the capital.

13:35.820 --> 13:37.460
If his shop were frequently closed,

13:37.460 --> 13:39.390
it would surely arouse suspicion.

13:39.460 --> 13:40.200
So,

13:40.380 --> 13:42.390
the three places
where he dumped the bodies

13:42.390 --> 13:44.450
can tell us the possible murder site.

13:45.400 --> 13:47.930
But these places
aren't close to one another.

13:51.360 --> 13:52.080
Your Highness.

13:52.080 --> 13:53.150
Constable Zhan,

13:53.170 --> 13:54.410
please put these pins

13:54.460 --> 13:55.570
onto the map,

13:55.770 --> 13:57.560
where the murderer disposed of the bodies.

13:57.560 --> 13:58.730
The first victim

13:58.750 --> 14:00.460
was found under Yushui Bridge.

14:00.460 --> 14:01.340
The second victim

14:01.340 --> 14:03.070
was left in an abandoned house.

14:03.310 --> 14:04.030
The third one

14:04.030 --> 14:05.560
was discovered in an alley.

14:06.500 --> 14:07.230
Red strings.

14:14.340 --> 14:15.740
The curfew starts at 11 p.m.,

14:15.740 --> 14:17.310
and is lifted at 3 a.m..

14:17.740 --> 14:19.310
To avoid being spotted,

14:19.620 --> 14:21.270
the murderer had to discard the bodies

14:21.270 --> 14:23.150
and return home
within this period of time.

14:23.150 --> 14:24.620
Besides, he couldn't use trolleys

14:24.620 --> 14:26.310
or horses to transport the bodies.

14:26.310 --> 14:27.980
It is hard for an average-sized adult man

14:27.980 --> 14:29.700
to walk four to five li within two hours

14:29.700 --> 14:31.340
while carrying a body

14:31.340 --> 14:32.150
weighing about 50 kilograms.

14:32.150 --> 14:33.500
Plus the time spent in resting,

14:33.500 --> 14:34.390
hiding from patrols

14:34.390 --> 14:35.580
and dealing with the bodies,

14:35.580 --> 14:37.500
it would take at least three hours.

14:37.500 --> 14:39.670
The rest of the time would be just enough
for him to go home

14:39.670 --> 14:41.270
and prepare to open the shop.

14:58.210 --> 14:59.090
This area is

14:59.390 --> 15:00.500
no more than five li away

15:00.500 --> 15:01.630
from each dump site.

15:02.460 --> 15:02.990
Bai Feng,

15:03.460 --> 15:04.790
take some people with you

15:04.790 --> 15:06.240
and look for the shops

15:06.260 --> 15:07.220
with stairways.

15:07.850 --> 15:09.580
The murderer could be a tailor,

15:09.790 --> 15:10.820
and his shop

15:10.820 --> 15:11.950
might be rented.

15:12.270 --> 15:13.030
I got it.

15:13.030 --> 15:14.070
Don't just check the shops.

15:14.070 --> 15:14.790
As His Highness said,

15:14.790 --> 15:16.270
the perpetrator is meticulous.

15:16.270 --> 15:16.980
He probably has

15:16.980 --> 15:18.840
a different hideout in this area.

15:19.030 --> 15:21.070
Make sure you check
every house with stairways.

15:21.070 --> 15:21.700
Yes.

15:22.670 --> 15:23.220
Bai Feng.

15:24.310 --> 15:25.340
In just a few hours,

15:25.340 --> 15:26.740
we'll hit the deadline.

15:26.740 --> 15:27.580
Take this token with you.

15:27.580 --> 15:28.910
Ignore today's curfew.

15:29.080 --> 15:29.740
Set out now.

15:35.790 --> 15:36.410
Your Highness,

15:36.410 --> 15:37.460
I have found some diners

15:37.460 --> 15:39.280
that sell fish porridge
in the West Market.

15:39.280 --> 15:40.630
I'll go with you to the West Market

15:40.630 --> 15:41.580
to interview the fish vendors.

15:41.580 --> 15:42.100
Okay.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.690
I want to go to the morgue

15:43.720 --> 15:46.180
to see if I can find new clues
from the bodies.

15:48.310 --> 15:49.910
I will accompany Master Wan.

15:50.480 --> 15:52.080
Don't worry, Your Highness.

15:54.740 --> 15:55.940
If anything happens,

15:55.950 --> 15:57.610
remember to use the Red Flare.

16:55.150 --> 16:56.790
I'm just a lowly prostitute.

16:57.960 --> 17:00.090
How am I able to afford your education?

17:00.660 --> 17:02.620
Why do you have to be a boy?

17:03.620 --> 17:05.270
Why are you a boy?

17:05.290 --> 17:06.180
Tell me.

17:06.349 --> 17:08.060
Why can't you be a girl?

17:08.060 --> 17:08.859
Why...

17:08.890 --> 17:10.210
Why aren't you a girl?

17:10.240 --> 17:11.530
If you were a girl,

17:11.550 --> 17:12.940
I could pimp you out

17:12.970 --> 17:13.819
for money.

17:14.000 --> 17:15.609
Why do you have to be a boy?

17:17.290 --> 17:17.920
Why?

17:18.390 --> 17:19.829
Why do you have to be a boy?

17:59.330 --> 18:00.390
Get me more liquor.

18:04.190 --> 18:04.980
Your Highness,

18:04.980 --> 18:07.260
there is a message

18:07.260 --> 18:08.990
from the Marquis of Zhongyong.

18:13.190 --> 18:15.260
The coroner I recommended

18:15.260 --> 18:16.540
has found some clues.

18:16.730 --> 18:17.410
Chi is

18:17.460 --> 18:18.950
hunting for the suspect.

18:19.390 --> 18:21.050
What else did the marquis say?

18:21.110 --> 18:21.740
His Grace

18:21.740 --> 18:23.950
told Your Highness not to worry.

18:27.630 --> 18:28.500
Good.

18:31.020 --> 18:32.910
If this case can be solved on time,

18:33.390 --> 18:36.190
the Marquis of Zhongyong
will surely be rewarded.

18:40.950 --> 18:42.740
[Morgue]

18:46.810 --> 18:47.850
Capital Prefect.

18:47.950 --> 18:48.500
Mr. Fang.

18:49.120 --> 18:50.870
Where are the three victims' bodies?

18:50.870 --> 18:51.700
Their bodies?

18:52.270 --> 18:53.670
Capital Prefect, didn't you just order

18:53.670 --> 18:54.880
the bodies to be taken away?

18:54.880 --> 18:56.440
I never gave that order.

18:57.890 --> 18:59.350
What about the victims' clothes?

18:59.350 --> 19:00.810
Taken away too, of course.

19:01.220 --> 19:02.270
I was truly baffled.

19:02.270 --> 19:03.710
It's freezing cold now.

19:03.830 --> 19:05.020
The bodies could've been buried

19:05.020 --> 19:05.870
after the case is closed.

19:05.870 --> 19:07.350
Do you know who took the bodies away?

19:07.350 --> 19:08.190
I certainly do.

19:08.190 --> 19:10.060
That was the officer
who brought the bodies over

19:10.060 --> 19:11.790
last time with Constable Zhan.

19:13.290 --> 19:14.670
It's Prince Cheng's doing again.

19:14.670 --> 19:15.980
How could this happen?

19:16.560 --> 19:18.210
He took all the evidence away.

19:18.210 --> 19:19.810
How are we supposed to solve the case?

19:19.810 --> 19:20.990
Let's go back to the prefect's office.

19:20.990 --> 19:23.720
His Highness will
definitely find new evidence.

19:28.700 --> 19:29.590
Gentlemen,

19:30.060 --> 19:30.920
you came early.

19:31.050 --> 19:32.100
The cooking has just started.

19:32.100 --> 19:32.980
In the West Market,

19:32.980 --> 19:34.110
our fish porridge

19:34.110 --> 19:35.430
has the most authentic local flavor.

19:35.430 --> 19:37.030
Serve some side dishes first.

19:37.030 --> 19:38.110
We'd like to taste

19:38.190 --> 19:39.980
your famous local-flavored porridge.

19:39.980 --> 19:41.310
Alright, just a moment.

19:43.440 --> 19:44.750
Your Highness, do you think

19:44.750 --> 19:45.970
this is where the third victim

19:45.970 --> 19:47.010
last ate?

19:48.390 --> 19:49.540
The third victim

19:49.750 --> 19:50.810
lived outside the city.

19:50.810 --> 19:52.220
She rarely came in town for procurements.

19:52.220 --> 19:53.550
I bet she'd love to taste

19:53.630 --> 19:56.490
the most authentic
local-flavored fish porridge.

19:56.740 --> 19:58.110
Food's coming!

20:04.460 --> 20:05.020
Mister,

20:05.950 --> 20:07.150
look at this sachet of yours.

20:07.150 --> 20:08.540
Are you getting married soon?

20:08.540 --> 20:09.740
You're mistaken, sir.

20:09.740 --> 20:11.260
This sachet isn't mine.

20:11.510 --> 20:13.850
Previously, a young lady
came for porridge

20:13.850 --> 20:15.130
and left it behind.

20:15.540 --> 20:16.150
Well,

20:16.150 --> 20:17.150
I thought she'd come back for it,

20:17.150 --> 20:19.490
so I hung it on my waist
for it to be easily noticed.

20:19.490 --> 20:20.640
Do you remember

20:20.660 --> 20:22.520
what that young lady was wearing?

20:23.830 --> 20:24.760
She was in...

20:25.830 --> 20:27.560
ordinary ko-hemp, as I recall.

20:27.900 --> 20:28.760
Your Highness,

20:29.110 --> 20:30.090
the third victim

20:30.240 --> 20:32.370
was exactly wearing ko-hemp clothes.

20:32.570 --> 20:34.640
I-Is that young lady dead?

20:34.660 --> 20:35.310
Then...

20:35.340 --> 20:36.260
this sachet...

20:36.280 --> 20:36.840
How...

20:36.870 --> 20:37.550
should I...

20:42.590 --> 20:44.870
This is a contract about the making of
a wedding dress.

20:44.870 --> 20:46.470
The pickup date is precisely

20:47.520 --> 20:49.320
the day of the victim's missing.

20:51.300 --> 20:52.110
Shopkeeper!

20:53.300 --> 20:54.020
Sir.

20:54.300 --> 20:55.190
Sit down, miss.

20:58.630 --> 20:59.430
Have some tea.

21:00.090 --> 21:00.960
Take a rest.

21:02.670 --> 21:03.460
Thank you.

21:04.390 --> 21:06.450
There are only a few stitches to make.

21:06.780 --> 21:08.220
The dress will be finished soon.

21:08.220 --> 21:09.080
Thank you, sir.

21:09.540 --> 21:10.400
How kind of you.

21:40.630 --> 21:41.630
It's Jinyi Shop!

21:42.350 --> 21:42.880
Bai Feng,

21:43.460 --> 21:45.320
follow the map to find Jinyi Shop.

21:45.670 --> 21:46.800
Catch the murderer.

21:46.910 --> 21:48.190
All the physical evidence
has gone missing now,

21:48.190 --> 21:50.060
so we must secure the testimonies.

21:50.060 --> 21:50.590
Yes!

21:52.190 --> 21:53.190
Capital Prefect,

21:53.290 --> 21:55.220
we may arrest the murderer in time,

21:55.260 --> 21:56.350
but without physical evidence,

21:56.350 --> 21:58.430
Prince Cheng can still make false claims.

21:58.430 --> 21:59.740
What is there to do then?

21:59.740 --> 22:02.090
I suggest you write a memorial
to condemn yourself.

22:02.090 --> 22:03.720
It's time for Master Wan to leave

22:03.720 --> 22:05.370
and prepare to attend the royal banquet.

22:05.370 --> 22:06.870
I'll write the memorial right away.

22:06.870 --> 22:07.620
Master Wan,

22:07.900 --> 22:09.630
I deeply appreciate your help.

22:14.710 --> 22:17.260
Now, you need to think about
tonight's royal banquet.

22:17.260 --> 22:20.320
Isn't it time for the Emperor
to meet the talent I hired?

22:20.630 --> 22:22.020
Do I really have to go?

22:22.500 --> 22:23.830
The Marquis of Zhongyong

22:23.830 --> 22:25.690
would definitely make Qin Wan go.

22:27.580 --> 22:30.780
[Capital Prefecture]

22:28.500 --> 22:29.300
I'm not going.

22:30.830 --> 22:32.590
It's the annual New Year's
royal gathering.

22:32.590 --> 22:33.980
You've been absent from it every year.

22:33.980 --> 22:35.260
This is a family reunion.

22:35.260 --> 22:36.660
How could you not join us?

22:36.760 --> 22:38.460
Which of those people is my family?

22:38.460 --> 22:39.540
I didn't share the same surname with them

22:39.540 --> 22:40.740
until 20 years ago.

22:41.150 --> 22:42.550
I'd hate to be an eyesore.

22:42.580 --> 22:44.480
I'd better spare them
from the awkwardness of seeing me,

22:44.480 --> 22:45.210
an outsider.

22:45.350 --> 22:46.860
How are you an outsider?

22:51.790 --> 22:52.720
I'm leaving now.

22:53.800 --> 22:54.380
You...

22:54.780 --> 22:55.840
Tomorrow morning,

22:55.870 --> 22:57.460
I'll pay a New Year's visit to Madam.

22:57.460 --> 22:58.190
Okay!

22:58.250 --> 22:59.580
I'll be waiting for you.

23:00.630 --> 23:01.960
What are you doing here?

23:02.430 --> 23:05.500
Chi specially asked me
to prepare clothes and jewelry for you.

23:05.500 --> 23:06.190
I also need to

23:06.190 --> 23:08.430
instruct you on court etiquette
and codes of conduct.

23:08.430 --> 23:09.260
You have no idea

23:09.260 --> 23:10.740
how calculating and cunning

23:10.740 --> 23:11.980
the capital's noble ladies are.

23:11.980 --> 23:13.430
How can I send you to the lion's den

23:13.430 --> 23:15.020
without giving you some tips first?

23:15.020 --> 23:16.150
What do I have to fear?

23:16.150 --> 23:17.670
I'll just pretend not to
understand anything,

23:17.670 --> 23:18.630
being all quiet and still.

23:18.630 --> 23:21.160
Those cunning ladies
can't do anything to me.

23:21.500 --> 23:22.870
Impressive. What a smart strategy—

23:22.870 --> 23:23.980
playing dumb.

23:24.580 --> 23:25.170
Ning,

23:25.700 --> 23:27.460
I have only one reminder for you.

23:27.460 --> 23:28.190
During the royal banquet,

23:28.190 --> 23:29.870
I'll be visiting the Empress Dowager
in Funing Palace.

23:29.870 --> 23:31.330
If anyone bullies you two,

23:31.350 --> 23:32.590
don't hesitate to fight back.

23:32.590 --> 23:34.460
The blood of resistance
flows in our family.

23:34.460 --> 23:36.630
Everyone knows about
Grandmother's hot temper.

23:36.630 --> 23:37.320
Chi,

23:37.430 --> 23:38.460
you should be telling me

23:38.460 --> 23:40.190
not to strike too hard instead.

23:43.390 --> 23:44.260
Chi,

23:44.590 --> 23:45.780
why didn't you ask Little Wan'er

23:45.780 --> 23:47.630
what she fed you before eating it?

23:47.630 --> 23:49.960
Wan offered it to me.
Did I even need to ask?

23:50.090 --> 23:51.700
This pill helps him stay sober.

23:51.700 --> 23:53.220
He can have a lot of drinks

23:53.220 --> 23:54.630
without getting drunk.

23:55.560 --> 23:56.360
I want one too.

24:35.160 --> 24:36.840
Why are you born a woman,

24:36.860 --> 24:38.210
but I'm not?

25:15.910 --> 25:17.830
You're merely the daughter of
the Duke of Zhong.

25:16.460 --> 25:18.730
[Yan Zhen]
[A royal princess]

25:18.190 --> 25:19.700
How dare you sit next to me.

25:20.210 --> 25:21.780
Who do you think you are?

25:20.480 --> 25:22.050
[Feng Chenbi]

25:22.680 --> 25:23.400
Maids,

25:24.020 --> 25:25.020
get her a new seat.

25:27.740 --> 25:31.220
The Emperor designated
Noble Consort Su to organize this banquet.

25:31.220 --> 25:32.550
His Majesty allowed me

25:32.570 --> 25:34.280
to sit in this very place.

25:35.020 --> 25:37.150
Your Highness had better
mind your manners.

25:37.150 --> 25:38.150
Otherwise,

25:38.410 --> 25:40.410
you'll be a disgrace to the Empress.

25:42.820 --> 25:44.000
The girl in the left front seat

25:44.000 --> 25:46.600
is Princess Yan Zhen,
the Empress's daughter.

25:46.720 --> 25:47.800
The girl next to her

25:48.060 --> 25:49.060
is Feng Chenbi,

25:49.060 --> 25:52.160
whose father, the Duke of Zhong, is
Noble Consort Su's confidant.

25:52.160 --> 25:53.090
These two girls

25:53.120 --> 25:54.390
are arch nemeses.

25:55.680 --> 25:57.350
But whenever Qin Zhaoyu shows up,

25:57.350 --> 25:59.680
they two will immediately become allies.

26:00.890 --> 26:02.130
Is Feng Chenbi

26:02.160 --> 26:03.410
also into the Crown Prince?

26:03.410 --> 26:05.460
Not all the rivalries among noble ladies

26:05.460 --> 26:07.790
throughout history are about men, right?

26:10.300 --> 26:13.190
This banquet was organized
by Noble Consort Su.

26:13.520 --> 26:15.660
The Empress didn't take part in it at all.

26:15.660 --> 26:16.790
So, you can see

26:16.810 --> 26:18.920
who's having an edge now.

26:19.440 --> 26:21.910
Royal concubines fight one another
with all means

26:21.910 --> 26:23.560
only for their children's sake.

26:23.560 --> 26:25.740
A favored mother's son enjoys more power.

26:25.740 --> 26:28.510
That's why Prince Cheng always has
the upper hand over the Crown Prince.

26:28.510 --> 26:30.820
It is also why the Qin family
is facing many obstacles

26:30.820 --> 26:32.210
in its every attempt

26:32.230 --> 26:34.560
to marry a daughter into the royal family.

26:36.310 --> 26:37.610
A boisterous occasion, isn't it?

26:37.610 --> 26:38.340
Yes, indeed.

27:00.720 --> 27:01.610
Your aunt

27:01.640 --> 27:03.600
should've been seated at the back.

27:04.520 --> 27:06.650
But the Empress likes Qin Zhaoyu a lot,

27:06.650 --> 27:08.650
so your aunt could get a seat
in the middle row.

27:08.650 --> 27:09.640
Speaking of which,

27:09.640 --> 27:11.460
given your help to the Crown Prince
this time,

27:11.460 --> 27:13.790
the Empress might treat you differently.

27:14.060 --> 27:15.120
If that happens...

27:17.920 --> 27:20.430
The Emperor arrives!

27:39.960 --> 27:41.820
[Zhao Shuhua]
[Empress]

27:42.120 --> 27:44.080
[Feng Lingsu]
[Noble Consort Su]

27:47.550 --> 27:49.700
Greetings, Your Majesty!

27:50.010 --> 27:52.570
The Empress Dowager
is feeling slightly unwell.

27:52.570 --> 27:54.920
I'll keep you company on her behalf.

27:54.940 --> 27:55.700
Everyone,

27:56.200 --> 27:58.330
just make yourself at home.

27:59.060 --> 28:01.500
Thank Your Majesty.

28:03.750 --> 28:04.590
Rise.

28:06.590 --> 28:07.420
Ning,

28:08.980 --> 28:10.430
is the lady beside you

28:10.870 --> 28:11.870
the Grand Princess's

28:11.870 --> 28:13.390
god-granddaughter?

28:13.830 --> 28:14.610
Yes, Your Majesty,

28:14.610 --> 28:15.240
she is.

28:20.050 --> 28:21.510
I'm Qin Wan. Greetings, Your Majesty.

28:21.510 --> 28:22.930
I wish Your Majesty
longevity and wellness.

28:22.930 --> 28:24.260
Forgo the formalities.

28:24.860 --> 28:25.990
Thank Your Majesty.

28:26.430 --> 28:27.490
The Grand Princess

28:27.670 --> 28:29.570
has told me what you did

28:29.670 --> 28:30.910
in Jingzhou.

28:31.150 --> 28:31.990
In the letter,

28:32.220 --> 28:33.590
she particularly asked me

28:33.590 --> 28:34.590
to take good care of

28:34.590 --> 28:35.910
her dear

28:36.240 --> 28:37.050
Wan.

28:37.430 --> 28:38.500
If not,

28:38.970 --> 28:41.580
she'll come to the capital with her whip.

28:42.020 --> 28:42.630
I am

28:42.780 --> 28:44.040
very much frightened.

28:45.410 --> 28:46.590
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

28:46.590 --> 28:48.390
I promise I'll take good care of myself

28:48.390 --> 28:50.110
and not worry the Grand Princess.

28:50.110 --> 28:51.520
Don't concern about me, Your Majesty.

28:51.520 --> 28:53.540
The prescription I made
for the Grand Princess

28:53.540 --> 28:55.150
is nerve-soothing.

28:55.670 --> 28:56.460
Her Highness

28:56.460 --> 28:58.590
hasn't raised her whip for a long time.

29:00.780 --> 29:02.430
Are Miss Qin's medical skills

29:02.430 --> 29:03.490
really good enough

29:03.600 --> 29:04.600
to change

29:04.620 --> 29:06.020
a person's temperament?

29:08.300 --> 29:09.100
Your Majesty,

29:09.600 --> 29:10.840
I'm an eyewitness

29:10.900 --> 29:12.350
to Wan's medical competence.

29:12.350 --> 29:13.060
In Jingzhou,

29:13.060 --> 29:15.390
people all refer to her
as a medical fairy.

29:15.430 --> 29:16.950
What a surprise
that the Marquis of Zhongyong

29:16.950 --> 29:18.950
has a medical fairy as his daughter.

29:19.460 --> 29:21.020
He is a blessed father.

29:22.160 --> 29:24.160
That's a much higher honor

29:24.190 --> 29:27.520
than the hollow title of
the capital's most talented woman.

29:30.490 --> 29:32.410
Women excel in different fields.

29:32.440 --> 29:34.220
Why compare them with one another?

29:34.220 --> 29:35.830
Be they good at arts, medicine,

29:35.830 --> 29:37.260
needlework, cooking or anything,

29:37.260 --> 29:38.460
they deserve respect and admiration

29:38.460 --> 29:39.660
as long as they are

29:39.780 --> 29:41.440
sensible women of integrity.

29:43.460 --> 29:44.190
Well said.

29:44.960 --> 29:46.330
I can't agree more with

29:46.540 --> 29:47.670
Miss Qin's opinion.

29:48.090 --> 29:49.670
Return to your seats, ladies.

29:49.670 --> 29:50.800
Thank Your Majesty.

30:15.280 --> 30:16.800
Why are you still out here?

30:17.780 --> 30:19.260
Are you waiting for me?

30:20.350 --> 30:21.280
Or are you afraid

30:21.850 --> 30:23.180
that Father will ask you

30:23.430 --> 30:24.780
about those women's murders?

30:24.780 --> 30:27.240
Had I known you cared
so much about this case,

30:27.300 --> 30:29.760
I would've asked Father
to let you handle it.

30:30.350 --> 30:33.150
You are the Crown Prince
who protects the capital,

30:33.260 --> 30:35.200
while I'm just the inferior Prince Cheng.

30:35.200 --> 30:37.540
How could I compare myself
with Your Highness?

30:37.540 --> 30:38.350
Crown Prince,

30:38.350 --> 30:39.190
Prince Cheng,

30:39.500 --> 30:40.150
the officials

30:40.150 --> 30:41.550
are waiting outside now.

30:45.220 --> 30:46.120
Announce our presence.

30:46.120 --> 30:46.670
Yes.

30:49.560 --> 30:50.610
[Chongming Palace]

30:53.110 --> 30:55.220
Happy New Year, Father.

30:55.220 --> 30:58.060
May Your Majesty be well in the new year.

31:00.040 --> 31:00.990
You may all rise.

31:03.630 --> 31:05.590
-Thank you, Father.
-Thank Your Majesty.

31:05.590 --> 31:06.300
Be seated.

31:12.980 --> 31:14.040
Come on, everyone.

31:14.910 --> 31:15.540
Drink

31:15.720 --> 31:17.290
this up.

31:17.870 --> 31:20.190
I wish you wellness in the new year.

31:21.380 --> 31:24.420
We wish Your Majesty wellness
in the new year.

31:26.740 --> 31:30.700
The Heir of Prince Rui is requesting
an audience with Your Majesty.

31:31.980 --> 31:33.020
Chi has arrived.

31:33.430 --> 31:34.230
Let him in now!

31:47.430 --> 31:48.320
Your Majesty,

31:48.390 --> 31:49.640
I wish you longevity and wellness.

31:49.640 --> 31:50.770
Happy New Year.

31:51.300 --> 31:52.560
Forgo the formalities.

31:52.560 --> 31:53.600
Thank Your Majesty.

31:53.600 --> 31:54.290
Come on,

31:54.590 --> 31:55.590
give Chi

31:55.610 --> 31:56.480
a bigger glass.

31:57.260 --> 31:58.830
Fill it up to make up for the drink

31:58.830 --> 31:59.740
he missed.

32:03.410 --> 32:05.010
Your Highness, here you are.

32:10.630 --> 32:12.670
You're just like your father.

32:13.100 --> 32:14.000
Yuan Qing,

32:14.110 --> 32:15.500
give him a refill.

32:15.910 --> 32:16.460
Yes.

32:16.980 --> 32:18.190
Watching Chi drink

32:18.500 --> 32:19.430
is such a delight

32:19.540 --> 32:21.150
for me.

32:23.740 --> 32:24.700
Bravo!

32:34.340 --> 32:35.170
Your Majesty,

32:35.740 --> 32:39.460
though this is a family gathering,
I still have to make a report.

32:40.200 --> 32:41.150
Mr. Song,

32:41.270 --> 32:43.030
what do you have to report?

32:43.050 --> 32:44.330
Your Majesty,

32:44.390 --> 32:45.590
on this New Year's Eve,

32:45.590 --> 32:47.830
while the people are celebrating,

32:47.830 --> 32:48.780
I can't help but

32:49.300 --> 32:51.740
think of those brutally murdered girls

32:51.740 --> 32:53.140
and their families.

32:53.300 --> 32:55.450
It really unsettles me.

32:56.550 --> 32:58.540
How can they spend
this joyous occasion happily

32:58.540 --> 33:01.110
with grief and anger
weighing on their hearts?

33:01.110 --> 33:02.720
The time limit has been reached.

33:02.720 --> 33:04.610
Crown Prince, please give updates

33:04.610 --> 33:06.430
on the investigation of this case,

33:06.430 --> 33:08.230
so as to ease the people's minds.

33:10.630 --> 33:11.500
Father,

33:12.300 --> 33:13.890
significant progress has been made
for this case.

33:13.890 --> 33:15.420
It will be solved very soon.

33:21.540 --> 33:22.670
What progress?

33:30.660 --> 33:31.360
I...

33:31.550 --> 33:32.310
I...

33:40.300 --> 33:40.950
I

33:41.540 --> 33:42.940
have a report to present.

33:44.110 --> 33:44.910
I'll allow it.

33:51.300 --> 33:52.300
Your Majesty,

33:52.590 --> 33:53.950
the case about the murdered girls

33:53.950 --> 33:55.210
was just solved today.

33:55.870 --> 33:56.950
The Crown Prince was reluctant

33:56.950 --> 33:59.490
to bring it up in the royal banquet
on the New Year's Eve,

33:59.490 --> 34:01.620
so I didn't dare to present the report.

34:02.160 --> 34:03.820
This memorial was written
by the capital prefect

34:03.820 --> 34:05.870
to state the conclusion of this case.

34:05.870 --> 34:07.530
Please read it, Your Majesty.

34:13.980 --> 34:15.330
The cold-blooded and brutal murderer

34:15.330 --> 34:17.489
failed to take another girl's life,
thanks to the timely arrival of

34:17.489 --> 34:20.020
Constable Zhan
from the capital prefecture.

34:20.600 --> 34:21.600
This tailor

34:22.560 --> 34:25.159
committed gruesome murders
out of jealousy of

34:25.389 --> 34:26.760
women marrying up.

34:29.179 --> 34:30.310
How astounding it is

34:30.719 --> 34:31.590
to uncover

34:31.620 --> 34:32.949
such a vicious murderer

34:33.230 --> 34:34.710
in my reign!

34:35.350 --> 34:36.150
Your Majesty,

34:36.790 --> 34:37.449
this person

34:37.710 --> 34:39.179
was traumatized from being abused

34:39.179 --> 34:40.710
in childhood by his mother.

34:40.830 --> 34:42.810
This brutal killer deserves no sympathy.

34:42.810 --> 34:44.639
It has to be made clear
that his motive was purely personal

34:44.639 --> 34:46.120
and unrelated to Your Majesty's reign.

34:46.120 --> 34:47.350
The fact that this bizarre murder case

34:47.350 --> 34:49.310
could be solved within several days

34:49.310 --> 34:50.230
exactly proves

34:50.340 --> 34:53.540
Your Majesty's administration
effective and reliable.

34:55.350 --> 34:56.460
Good.

34:56.870 --> 34:57.980
Rise and talk.

34:58.500 --> 35:00.830
-Thank you, Father.
-Thank Your Majesty.

35:01.660 --> 35:03.500
The Crown Prince and the capital prefect

35:03.500 --> 35:04.900
have both done a good job.

35:05.230 --> 35:06.140
Besides, I've noticed

35:06.140 --> 35:08.330
from the capital prefect's memorial

35:08.580 --> 35:09.910
that some obvious clues

35:10.100 --> 35:11.500
were revealed

35:11.830 --> 35:12.690
by

35:12.850 --> 35:14.040
the coroner.

35:14.580 --> 35:15.830
How come this talent

35:15.830 --> 35:16.710
hadn't made

35:16.710 --> 35:18.640
any notable achievements before?

35:20.330 --> 35:21.290
Your Majesty,

35:21.910 --> 35:22.860
this coroner

35:23.200 --> 35:25.940
was recently recommended
by the Crown Prince's royal guardian—

35:25.940 --> 35:26.710
Qin Shu,

35:26.740 --> 35:28.200
the Marquis of Zhongyong.

35:32.620 --> 35:33.420
Your Majesty,

35:34.140 --> 35:35.980
for the wellbeing of the country,

35:35.980 --> 35:38.380
I'd gladly do anything
within my capacity.

35:38.980 --> 35:39.910
Mr. Qin,

35:40.390 --> 35:41.320
I appreciate it.

35:50.320 --> 35:51.120
Your Majesty,

35:51.230 --> 35:51.910
there is

35:51.960 --> 35:53.820
a memorial asking for punishment

35:53.910 --> 35:55.270
awaiting your review.

35:58.910 --> 36:00.040
The capital prefect

36:00.140 --> 36:01.830
admits that he failed to
keep the evidence safe

36:01.830 --> 36:03.690
and is now asking for punishment.

36:11.660 --> 36:12.180
This...

36:13.060 --> 36:14.830
The victims' clothes went missing.

36:14.830 --> 36:16.620
Their bodies were destroyed.

36:17.060 --> 36:18.230
I can't believe

36:18.710 --> 36:20.640
the capital prefecture would make

36:21.290 --> 36:23.490
such a huge mistake right under my nose!

36:23.510 --> 36:25.310
I vouch for the capital prefect.

36:25.540 --> 36:26.710
Every word in the memorial

36:26.710 --> 36:27.840
is absolutely true.

36:28.230 --> 36:28.960
In that case,

36:29.390 --> 36:30.270
I'll assign you

36:30.540 --> 36:31.420
to arrest those

36:31.440 --> 36:32.320
who destroyed the evidence

36:32.320 --> 36:34.060
and obstructed the official investigation

36:34.060 --> 36:34.910
immediately.

36:35.650 --> 36:36.330
Yes,

36:36.460 --> 36:37.920
as Your Majesty commands.

36:46.860 --> 36:47.820
Crown Prince,

36:47.980 --> 36:50.060
you dealt with this matter properly

36:50.080 --> 36:51.170
and meticulously.

36:52.020 --> 36:52.920
As we are

36:52.940 --> 36:54.400
celebrating the New Year,

36:54.750 --> 36:55.430
maintaining

36:55.430 --> 36:57.930
the peace and prosperity of the country is

36:58.230 --> 36:59.430
indeed our priority.

37:01.310 --> 37:02.980
Thank you for your praise, Father.

37:02.980 --> 37:03.600
Alright.

37:03.950 --> 37:05.240
Be seated then, everyone.

37:05.240 --> 37:07.570
-Thank you, Father.
-Thank Your Majesty.

37:09.060 --> 37:09.830
Come on,

37:10.540 --> 37:11.670
raise your glasses.

37:13.060 --> 37:14.430
Let us

37:14.580 --> 37:15.460
toast to

37:15.460 --> 37:17.230
a prosperous new year.

37:18.430 --> 37:21.870
May Your Majesty be well in the new year.

37:52.620 --> 37:54.920
[Empress Dowager]

38:05.290 --> 38:06.090
Your Majesty!

38:09.580 --> 38:11.780
Are you feeling unwell, Your Highness?

38:12.580 --> 38:14.910
All this coughing is making my chest ache.

38:14.980 --> 38:16.840
Shall I ask for a royal physician?

38:17.350 --> 38:18.390
No need.

38:18.660 --> 38:20.060
It happens every year.

38:21.710 --> 38:22.840
This is the New Year's Eve.

38:22.840 --> 38:24.640
I'd hate to disturb the Emperor.

38:26.700 --> 38:28.300
My chest feels very tight.

38:29.230 --> 38:30.690
Help me step out for some fresh air.

38:30.690 --> 38:31.350
Yes.

38:34.020 --> 38:34.620
Slowly.

38:42.850 --> 38:43.650
Your Majesty?

38:43.830 --> 38:44.630
Your Majesty?

38:44.980 --> 38:45.780
Your Majesty!

38:46.040 --> 38:46.840
Your Majesty!

38:47.430 --> 38:48.230
Help!

38:49.100 --> 38:50.540
Get the royal physicians here!

38:50.540 --> 38:51.850
Go to Chongming Palace

38:52.020 --> 38:53.480
to inform the Emperor now!

38:53.510 --> 38:54.280
Yes.

38:54.860 --> 38:55.660
Your Majesty?

38:56.170 --> 38:56.970
Your Majesty?

39:22.910 --> 39:25.650
Let the evil-repelling ritual commence!

41:04.720 --> 41:05.660
The player of that general

41:05.660 --> 41:06.930
must be from the Imperial Guards.

41:06.930 --> 41:08.790
He has excellent martial skills.

41:11.610 --> 41:12.430
Indeed.

41:23.580 --> 41:25.020
Very good.

41:47.460 --> 41:48.360
I, Yan Chi,

41:48.460 --> 41:49.660
wish Your Majesty

41:49.660 --> 41:50.990
a lifetime of wellness!

41:52.710 --> 41:53.290
He...

41:53.500 --> 41:55.140
He's Chi, isn't he?

41:55.750 --> 41:57.020
In the blink of an eye,

41:57.020 --> 41:59.100
how did you go from a real general

41:59.180 --> 42:00.910
to a fake one?

42:01.020 --> 42:01.820
Your Majesty,

42:01.870 --> 42:03.100
the people will benefit from

42:03.100 --> 42:04.020
your wisdom.

42:04.500 --> 42:05.980
I stand ready to repel all evil

42:05.980 --> 42:07.060
for Your Majesty,

42:07.060 --> 42:07.980
as it is also my duty.

42:07.980 --> 42:08.910
Good.

42:09.180 --> 42:10.870
I'd love to hear that!

42:11.500 --> 42:12.230
Now,

42:12.680 --> 42:14.870
you're the vice minister of
the Ministry of Justice.

42:14.870 --> 42:15.630
You shall

42:15.870 --> 42:18.000
safeguard the country's peace for me.

42:18.460 --> 42:19.590
Thank Your Majesty!

42:20.100 --> 42:20.870
Alright.

42:21.950 --> 42:22.790
You may rise.

42:22.790 --> 42:23.920
Thank Your Majesty.

42:32.950 --> 42:33.790
How

42:34.230 --> 42:35.710
considerate of Chi.

42:37.310 --> 42:38.840
Now that the ritual is over,

42:39.180 --> 42:40.050
Empress,

42:40.270 --> 42:41.270
let's go to

42:41.310 --> 42:42.580
Zhenghua Gate

42:42.980 --> 42:44.510
to celebrate this occasion

42:44.540 --> 42:45.950
with all the commoners.

42:46.620 --> 42:47.950
Yes, as Your Majesty commands.

42:47.950 --> 42:48.460
Good.

42:49.660 --> 42:50.460
Your Majesty!

42:52.460 --> 42:53.430
Your Majesty,

42:53.430 --> 42:54.280
the Empress Dowager...

42:54.280 --> 42:55.740
is in critical condition!

42:55.930 --> 42:57.260
How come?

42:57.310 --> 42:58.540
Her Majesty suddenly fell ill.

42:58.540 --> 42:59.460
Then...

42:59.460 --> 43:01.180
why didn't she ask for a royal physician?

43:01.180 --> 43:03.020
All the royal physicians are

43:03.020 --> 43:04.430
in Funing Palace now.

43:04.460 --> 43:05.660
The problem is,

43:05.660 --> 43:07.230
Her Majesty can't ingest any medical soup.

43:07.230 --> 43:08.060
Her Majesty is lingering

43:08.060 --> 43:09.390
between life and death!

43:09.910 --> 43:11.110
Prepare my carriage!

43:27.710 --> 43:28.620
Little Wan'er,

43:28.620 --> 43:29.750
please go check on the Empress Dowager.

43:29.750 --> 43:30.950
She treats me nicely.

43:31.020 --> 43:32.100
The situation is unclear now.

43:32.100 --> 43:33.870
Any rash decisions could
turn us into someone else's pawns.

43:33.870 --> 43:35.100
Don't worry. If possible,

43:35.100 --> 43:36.560
I'll definitely help her.

43:36.580 --> 43:37.170
Okay.

43:43.100 --> 43:43.900
Your Majesty.

43:44.870 --> 43:45.620
Your Majesty,

43:45.620 --> 43:46.750
this is the beginning of a new year.

43:46.750 --> 43:47.580
If the people

43:47.710 --> 43:49.470
can't see the Emperor, the Empress
and the Crown Prince,

43:49.470 --> 43:51.620
I'm afraid they'll be thrown into panic.

43:51.620 --> 43:52.350
Your Majesty!

43:52.350 --> 43:54.660
Your Majesty, the country's wellness
comes before anything!
